		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If you see a fork in the road inside a\ncave, one way is right and one is a\fdead end.\fBut people gotta try both anyway.\fThat’s life, bro.\rYou goin’ up the ladder or down the\nladder?</language>
